WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:08.717
Let me go! What are you doing?

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:11.177
Put a lid on it!

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.805
Nice place you got, kid.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.265
Get out!

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.518
This is my house!

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.938
Oh, come off it.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.149
Can't even protect a little girl...

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.776
-What do you say?
-He's got gold!

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:30.196
Sold her for money, huh?

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.240
No! I wouldn't do that!

00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:34.993
You let them pay you off?

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.538
Sheeta told me to do it.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.457
So...

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.627
So you gave in and crawled home.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.172
You call yourself a man?

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:51.176
You talk big, but you're after Sheeta too.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.053
But of course, we're pirates.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:56.181
Pirates hunt for treasure.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:01.227
Those guys are strange ones.
What's the girl to them?

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:09.235
You think she'll get out alive?

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:16.743
So, Sheeta told you to leave?

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:20.205
They threatened her,
so she tried to save you.

00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:22.540
How do you know, Mama?

00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:25.376
I've been a woman for 50 years.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:29.672
She steels her heart
to save her man. How touching.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.966
Reminds me of my youth.

00:01:32.842 --> 00:01:36.221
If you boys want to get married,
look for one like her.

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:40.225
-So that girl will grow up...
-To be like Mama?

00:01:44.979 --> 00:01:46.689
What a waste.

